  "content": {
    "equation": "Bolus Dose:\nWhen Bolus Dose is \"yes\":\nBolus Dose (mL) = (Weight * Bolus Dose) / (Bolus Concentration * 1000)\n• Bolus Dose (mL) is calculated in mL\n• Weight is input in kg\n• Bolus Dose is input in mcg/kg\n• Bolus Concentration is input in mg/mL\nInfusion Rate:\nInfusion Rate = (Dose * Weight * 60) / (Infusion Concentration * 1000)\n• Infusion Rate is calculated in mL/hour\n• Dose is input in mcg/kg/minute\n• Weight is input in kg\n• Infusion Concentration is input in mg/mL",
